<title>USA: Superior Consultant unit to buy firm.</title>
<headline>Superior Consultant unit to buy firm.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Consultant Holdings Corp said Friday a letter of intent has been signed for its healthcare consulting subsidiary, Superior Consultant Co Inc, to acquire Chi Systems Inc in a merger transaction.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Chi Systems, based in Ann Arbor, Mich., is a strategic, operational and facility planning consulting firm dedicated to the healthcare industry.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
